do_5 = "Provide the owner-requested immediate-beta deployment profile with a separate zero-delay timelock artifact, explicitly selected input and prediction/deployment entrypoints, while preserving the standard timelock delay and every authority, allowlist, replay, funding, genesis and finalization check. Run all bootstrap phases sequentially without advancing chain time. Prove same-block beta execution, unauthorized-call and replay rejection, standard delay enforcement, and rejection of a profile mismatch with an existing deployment record. Existing deployed contracts are not rewritten by source edits."
