do_2 = "Fix every other defect that stops layerxd --serve bootstrapping from a fresh layerx-genesis-build genesis with absent log files, including log creation capacity in path_empty_or_absent/lxp_log_open and the replica's log growth, so that the sequencer and --authority-replica start, accept a SEND over the LNI, and publish batch evidence to the replica; keep bootstrap_storage_empty and verify_bootstrap_genesis strict."
