do_5 = "Write bridge/deploy/proposals/proposals_test.go decoding every emitted body back into the real message types with unknown fields forbidden, running their ValidateBasic, asserting the native cap is present and first, asserting the Solana Sidiora cap against the asset id the chain fixes, and covering the manifest disagreement and each placeholder refusal; drive it from committed inputs under bridge/deploy/proposals/testdata so the package stands alone."
