do_2 = "Give it four jobs whose names say what they run: forge test for bridge/evm after cloning forge-std v1.9.6 and openzeppelin-contracts v5.3.0 the way paxeer-forge-test.yml clones them; cargo test and cargo build-sbf for bridge/solana; cargo test for the layerx-bridge-relayer crate; and the bridge/deploy tooling leg running that directory's Go packages, bridge/vectors and the offline check scripts."
