do_2 = "Add a trust_history step to docker/kernel/init.sh that, once core.env and sequencer-public-key exist, writes $human_state/trust-history atomically (temporary file then mv, root:4020 0440) with that encoding and LAYERX_NODE_NETWORK_ID, and never rewrites an existing history; human_security_prepare keeps projecting it as trust-history and the human-security service keeps waiting on it, so the security provider's LAYERX_HUMAN_SECURITY_PROVIDER_TRUST_HISTORY names a history the kernel's own sequencer signs."
