do_2 = "Generate the webhooks trigger token once in a tmpfs directory on the operator host and stage it in one step to all four consumers, each through flyctl secrets import --stage on stdin: WEBHOOKS_SOURCE_TRIGGER_TOKEN on paxeer-webhooks, ENDPOINT_EVENTS_WEBHOOKS_TOKEN on paxeer-shared-endpoint, HUMAN_EVENTS_WEBHOOKS_TOKEN on paxeer-human-service and REGISTRY_WEBHOOKS_EVENTS_TOKEN on paxeer-registry, deleting the tmpfs directory in the same step so no trigger file is retained; copy the journeys and approvals producer tokens from their machines into HUMAN_EVENTS_JOURNEY_TOKEN and HUMAN_EVENTS_APPROVAL_TOKEN on paxeer-human-service through flyctl ssh console piped into flyctl secrets import --stage, never printed."
