do_6 = "Consume the shared scan components from explorer/frontend/ui/shared/scan and touch nothing else under explorer/frontend/ui/shared or explorer/frontend/ui/snippets; write no literal colour, font family, radius or shadow, keep both appearances resolving through the same tokens, add no dependency, and change no file ending in .pw.tsx and no __screenshots__ directory."
