do_2 = "Register operator_verification with the policy engine in internal/policy/kinds.go as a kind of its own whose only accepted view is the verification message, so it can never sign an EVM transaction, typed data, a personal message, a digest or any kernel payload, and no other kind can sign the verification message; the schema human/wallet/schema/attestor-api/v1.kvx gains the kind, its request and response fields and its refusal codes, and the golden vector sign.request.operator_verification.json is generated from the implementation beside the others."
