do_4 = "Add backup_test.go covering the atomic name sequence, the audit event and its digest, retention with and without a shipper ledger, restore into an empty directory followed by a signature with the quorum, and refusal of a wrong digest, a foreign node id and a non-empty directory; extend store_test.go for the new snapshot version, health_test.go for the snapshot age, and server tests proving a snapshot follows each key-changing operation."
