do_2 = "Make the gateway set a response header that names it on every response, and extend scripts/wallet/check-live.sh with a cutover mode that confirms the public hostname, taken from an environment variable with no default, is served by the new gateway through that header; record the run in the qualification log without hosts or secrets."
