do_3 = "Tune the React Query defaults in explorer/frontend/lib/api/useQueryClientConfig.tsx alone - a stale time per resource class covering the records a hash or a number addresses, the configuration the backend rewrites at deploy time, the network statistics and the resources that follow the chain head, beside the bounded retry and the window-focus refetch already there - and apply it in explorer/frontend/lib/api/useApiQuery.tsx so that a caller's own stale time still wins."
do_4 = "Let a paged list hold the rows of the page it is leaving by wrapping the placeholder data the caller passes in explorer/frontend/ui/shared/pagination/useQueryWithPages.ts so the previous page's answer is the placeholder of the next one, leaving the hook's paging behaviour, its returned shape and its existing spec exactly as they are."
do_5 = "Start the independent queries of a page together: in explorer/frontend/ui/address/utils/useAddressCountersQuery.ts let the counters request leave with the address request instead of waiting for its answer while the RPC fallback stays gated on that answer, and in explorer/frontend/ui/pages/Token.tsx start the address request with the token request instead of waiting for the socket to join and gate the transfers, inventory and holders lists on the token answer alone."
do_6 = "Let the heavy client-only widgets arrive only when they are needed - the verified-fetch client of explorer/frontend/ui/shared/nft/useLoadImageViaIpfs.tsx and the QR code generator of explorer/frontend/ui/address/details/AddressQrCode.tsx behind an import inside the callback that uses them, and the coin balance chart of explorer/frontend/ui/address/AddressCoinBalance.tsx through next/dynamic with server rendering off and a placeholder of the chart's own height so nothing shifts."
do_7 = "Change no API resource, route, feature flag, query key, payload type or rendered field of any page - only when a request leaves, how long its answer stays fresh, and when its code arrives."
do_8 = "Add the vitest specs explorer/frontend/lib/api/useQueryClientConfig.spec.tsx, explorer/frontend/lib/api/useApiQuery.spec.tsx, explorer/frontend/ui/shared/pagination/useQueryWithPagesPreviousPage.spec.tsx, explorer/frontend/ui/address/utils/useAddressCountersQuery.spec.tsx, explorer/frontend/ui/shared/nft/useLoadImageViaIpfs.spec.tsx and explorer/frontend/ui/address/details/AddressQrCode.spec.tsx, and the cases in explorer/frontend/ui/pages/Token.spec.tsx and explorer/frontend/ui/address/AddressCoinBalance.spec.tsx, each exercising the real hook or component through explorer/frontend/vitest/lib.tsx with the repository's own payload mocks and asserting the stale time its resource class names, that the independent requests of a page leave in the same round, that a page turn keeps the previous rows, and that a lazy widget is fetched only when it is used."
