do_3 = "Before the live machine starts, read PAXSCAN_DATABASE_PUBLIC_URL from the explorer's Railway Postgres into a Fly secret of the indexer app on standard input without printing it, and run layerx-indexer backfill --cutover-height at the archive node's head read at run time in a one-off machine of the app on its volume, so the backfill from LAYERX_INDEXER_START_BLOCK up to the cutover is verified block by block against the archive node; then deploy the live machine on the same volume, which resumes at the cutover plus one."
do_4 = "Import LAYERX_GATEWAY_INDEXER_URL, the indexer's https .internal name, as a Fly secret of the endpoint app of human/wallet/deploy/endpoint.toml on standard input from the operator host, which restarts the router's machines."
